        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.453,
            0.246,
            0.826,
            0.295
          ],
          "content": "What do you observe? Do you see that the beam of laser light inside water follows a straight path?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.453,
            0.295,
            0.826,
            0.347
          ],
          "content": "However, light can sometimes even bend around corners! This is something you will learn in the higher grades."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.289,
            0.367,
            0.839,
            0.419
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "11.3 Light through Transparent, Translucent, and Opaque Materials"
